WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:02,080
If you are older, help me sell cakes on weekends

2
00:00:02,080 --> 00:00:04,480
There are too few opportunities to play with peers

3
00:00:04,480 --> 00:00:05,880
Oh my god

4
00:00:05,880 --> 00:00:07,480
Selling tickets and cakes is quite interesting.

5
00:00:07,480 --> 00:00:09,480
What are you talking about, sir?

6
00:00:09,480 --> 00:00:11,880
Here are all the things Miss Pei bought for her aunt.

7
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:15,500
I've seen this bag before

8
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:17,300
I often set up stalls in that school

9
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:19,100
This is what the principal's wife mentioned

10
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:21,900
This costs a lot of money, right?

11
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:23,300
Don't let the girl's family spend money

12
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:25,500
I will definitely return it to others in the future, eh eh

13
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:33,070
Hundreds, thousands, millions of these

14
00:00:33,070 --> 00:00:36,470
It cost more than a million in total. I want to pay

15
00:00:36,470 --> 00:00:37,470
She refused to give in

16
00:00:37,470 --> 00:00:40,530
I don’t mean it’s just a small token of my affection for you.

17
00:00:40,530 --> 00:00:43,130
What does Miss Pei do at home? Can we know?

18
00:00:43,130 --> 00:00:44,330
Don't worry, aunt

19
00:00:44,330 --> 00:00:46,130
No matter what Miss Pei does at home

20
00:00:46,130 --> 00:00:47,130
with sir

21
00:00:47,130 --> 00:00:48,130
All are high climbers
